 "nl": [
  "Allow printers to connect to backup using HTTP (TCP 80).",
  "Allow engineering to connect to partners using RDP (TCP 3389) and DNS over UDP 53.",
  "Allow monitoring to connect to partners using RDP (TCP 3389) and NTP (UDP 123) and IMAP (TCP 143).",
  "Apart from mail on DNS over UDP 53; edge-cache on NTP (UDP 123), all traffic originating in partners must be dropped.",
  "Make NTP (UDP 123) and HTTP (TCP 80) on student-lab reachable from all internal zones.",
  "Hosts in backup may reach engineering over MySQL (TCP 3306) and SSH (TCP 22).",
  "guest-wifi must accept HTTP (TCP 80) from admin.",
  "admin offers NTP (UDP 123) and DNS over UDP 53 to every zone."
